From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: r8q-arch <r8q-arch@example.invalid>
Date: Sun, 11 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] cpuidle: r8q default-off rail power-collapse states

The r8q board keeps its PSCI rail-power-collapse states in the cpuidle
table, but marks those states default-off from the board DT.  This preserves
the architectural WFI state and its counters while preventing registration
from selecting the two states implicated by the standby investigation.

The property is deliberately board-local and changes no PSCI suspend
parameter or latency value.  The companion r8q DT sets the property on the
two CPU rail-power-collapse nodes.
---
 drivers/cpuidle/dt_idle_states.c                   | 2 ++
 Documentation/devicetree/bindings/cpu/idle-states.yaml | 7 +++++++
 2 files changed, 9 insertions(+)

diff --git a/drivers/cpuidle/dt_idle_states.c b/drivers/cpuidle/dt_idle_states.c
--- a/drivers/cpuidle/dt_idle_states.c
+++ b/drivers/cpuidle/dt_idle_states.c
@@ -77,6 +77,8 @@ static int init_idle_state(struct device_node *state_node,
 		desc = state_node->name;
 
 	idle_state->flags = CPUIDLE_FLAG_RCU_IDLE;
+	if (of_property_read_bool(state_node, "samsung,r8q-cpuidle-off"))
+		idle_state->flags |= CPUIDLE_FLAG_OFF;
 	if (of_property_read_bool(state_node, "local-timer-stop"))
 		idle_state->flags |= CPUIDLE_FLAG_TIMER_STOP;
 	/*
diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/cpu/idle-states.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/cpu/idle-states.yaml
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/cpu/idle-states.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/cpu/idle-states.yaml
@@ -427,6 +427,13 @@
         description:
           A string used as a descriptive name for the idle state.
 
+      samsung,r8q-cpuidle-off:
+        type: boolean
+        description: |
+          Keep this idle state in the cpuidle table but disable it by default.
+          This is a board-local recovery/diagnostic policy; state0 WFI remains
+          available and state usage counters remain visible.
+
     additionalProperties: false
 
     required:
-- 
2.39.2
